  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: <span class=\"citation-59 citation-end-59\">Whole Tiles is a premier importer and distributor of natural stone and tile products based in New Jersey.</span><br>• What makes us different: <span class=\"citation-57 citation-end-57\">We are known for offering unprecedented access to one of the most diversified tile inventories in the United States at extremely low prices.</span> <span class=\"citation-56\">One of our biggest advantages is our </span><strong><span class=\"citation-56\">Free Shipping</span></strong><span class=\"citation-56 citation-end-56\"> policy on most orders within the U.S., regardless of size.</span> <span class=\"citation-55 citation-end-55\">Our team is passionate about design, providing expert advice to homeowners and professionals alike to ensure their vision is realized without hidden fees.</span><br>• How affiliates can earn: Our partners earn a competitive commission on every sale referred through their unique affiliate link or custom discount code. Given that tile projects often involve high order values, your earning potential is significant. We provide a transparent tracking dashboard so you can monitor your clicks, conversions, and commissions in real-time.<br>• How to promote us: We encourage our affiliates to share Whole Tiles through high-quality visual content. You can promote us by creating \"Room Transformation\" posts, writing blog guides on \"How to Choose the Right Marble,\" or sharing unboxing videos of our mosaic samples. Our products are perfect for Pinterest, Instagram, and home-improvement blogs where high-resolution imagery drives results.<br>• Other information:</p></div></div>",
